# The diagnostic baseline / post-fix log files are committed -- they are
# the regression reference for the pass-12-followup-3 parallel KSP/PC
# fix. The repository root .gitignore excludes "*.log", so the .mpi4.log
# files would be dropped without the negation below.
!*.mpi4.log

# Scratch / ad-hoc captures stay out of git. Name throwaway runs
# *.scratch.log.
*.scratch.log
